@startuml flight-domain-excerpt-for-us081
title Team Domain Model — Excerpt Relevant to US081 (Create Flight Plan from File)
caption Subset extracted from the project's main domain model.\nShows the aggregates created, referenced, or traversed by the import-from-file use case.

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #D6EAF8
skinparam classBorderColor      #5B9BD5
skinparam packageStyle           rectangle
skinparam packageBorderColor     #888888
skinparam defaultFontSize        11
hide empty members
left to right direction

' ============================================================
' Flight Aggregate — the FlightPlan is created inside here
' ============================================================
package "Flight Aggregate" {
    class Flight <<aggregate root>>
    class FlightDesignator <<value object>>

    class FlightPlan <<entity>> {
        flightPlanID
    }
    enum FlightPlanStatus <<enum>> {
        DRAFT
        VALIDATED
        TESTED
    }

    class FlightLeg <<entity>>
    class DepartureInfo <<value object>>
    class ArrivalInfo <<value object>>
    class FuelLoad <<value object>>

    class FlightSegment <<entity>>
    class Waypoint <<value object>>
    class Coordinates <<value object>>
    class AltitudeSlot <<value object>>
    class WindDirection <<value object>>
    class WindSpeed <<value object>>

    Flight *-- FlightDesignator
    Flight *-- "1..*" FlightPlan

    FlightPlan *-- FlightPlanStatus
    FlightPlan *-- "1..*" FlightLeg

    FlightLeg *-- DepartureInfo
    FlightLeg *-- ArrivalInfo
    FlightLeg *-- FuelLoad
    FlightLeg *-- "1..*" FlightSegment

    FlightSegment *-- "2" Waypoint : start, end
    FlightSegment *-- "1..*" AltitudeSlot
    FlightSegment *-- WindDirection
    FlightSegment *-- WindSpeed

    Waypoint *-- Coordinates
}

' ============================================================
' Pilot Aggregate — the actor who performs the import
' ============================================================
package "Pilot Aggregate" {
    class Pilot <<aggregate root>>
}

' ============================================================
' Airport Aggregate — referenced by departure/arrival info
' ============================================================
package "Airport Aggregate" {
    class Airport <<aggregate root>>
    class AirportIATACode <<value object>>
    class AirportICAOCode <<value object>>

    Airport *-- AirportIATACode
    Airport *-- AirportICAOCode
}

' ============================================================
' FlightRoute Aggregate — origin and destination of the flight
' ============================================================
package "FlightRoute Aggregate" {
    class FlightRoute <<aggregate root>>
    class RouteName <<value object>>

    FlightRoute *-- RouteName
}

' ============================================================
' Cross-aggregate relationships relevant to US081
' ============================================================
Flight     --> Pilot        : assigned to
Flight     --> FlightRoute  : for route

DepartureInfo --> Airport   : from
ArrivalInfo   --> Airport   : to
FlightRoute   --> "2" Airport : origin, destination

' ============================================================
' US081 import note
' ============================================================
note as ImportNote
  **US081 import flow**

  1. Pilot selects a .flight file.
  2. System validates it via US083 DSL compiler
     (lexical → syntactic → semantic).
  3. If invalid: error messages with phase, line, column.
     Import is aborted (AC#3, AC#4).
  4. If valid: a new FlightPlan is created with
     status = **DRAFT** and attached to the existing Flight
     identified by the designator in the DSL file.

  Status transitions:
    DRAFT (US081 import) → VALIDATED → TESTED
end note

ImportNote .. FlightPlan

@enduml